OL,3,GNorthern Ireland                       
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and   
OL,6,Fmostly dry in the evening. Remaining   
OL,7,Fcloudy overnight with a few outbreaks  
OL,8,Fof light rain in the south. Moderate   
OL,9,Fto fresh southeasterly winds. Quite    
OL,10,Fmild.                                  
OL,12,CMonday:FA mostly dry day although      
OL,13,Fstill with a fair amount of cloud.     
OL,14,FThere could be the odd spot of rain    
OL,15,Fover western counties later. Fresh     
OL,16,Fsoutheasterly wind.                    
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
