OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FA wet 
OL,6,Fwindy start on Tuesday then drying up  
OL,7,Fwinds easing. Mostly dry on Wednesday  
OL,8,Fand Thursday then rain likely later    
OL,9,FThursday.                              
